  "published": "2026-09-16T13:36:05.33Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This package is now published as Cynicszm.FlatFiles. It was previously FlatFiles, which belongs to the upstream project this is forked from. The assembly is still FlatFiles.dll and the namespaces are unchanged, so only the PackageReference needs updating. Targets .NET 10 exclusively; .NET 8 and .NET 9 are no longer supported, so stay on 6.0.4 if you need them. The deprecated System.* compatibility packages have been removed and the package now declares no dependencies. BREAKING: IRecordContext.Record is now empty for delimited files unless DelimitedOptions.PreserveRecordText is set to true. Skipping that text removes about a fifth of the allocation from reading a delimited file.",
